# November 28, 2026: Carnegie libraries of Tennessee: a batch of the pass the owner asked for to put the buildings
# Andrew Carnegie paid for on the map. Chattanooga's Old Library Building was already on the Atlas.
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia's list of Carnegie libraries in Tennessee and its articles; National Register
# records and nominations (the Park Service); the Nashville Public Library's own pages; the libraries', museums' and
# colleges' own pages; the National Park Service's page on the Mountain Branch; the University of Tennessee's Volopedia;
# BlackPast; Waymarking; Clio.
# Pins: ArcGIS geocoder points for street addresses; the Register's or Wikipedia's points where no address fits a building.
